{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Greed always comes with a price.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a remote part of the world, rumors of a cursed temple filled with untold treasures have spread like wildfire. You, a modern-day treasure hunter, decide to enter the ancient ruins \u2014 not knowing that no one has ever come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you step into the dark corridor lit by flickering torches, you are faced with a mysterious chest and three massive sealed doors. Each one leads to a unique and deadly path filled with puzzles, lurking horrors, and long-forgotten secrets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddff <strong>Solve intricate puzzles</strong> using light, symmetry, and ancient clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f <strong>Observe eerie statues</strong> with glowing eyes to uncover hidden mechanisms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf <strong>Avoid deadly creatures</strong> that patrol the halls \u2014 one wrong step means death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd10 <strong>Explore diverging paths</strong> filled with tension and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Collect lost relics</strong> hidden in cursed chambers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when you finally gather all the artifacts and return to the treasure chest...<br>You realize the true meaning of greed \u2014 and why no one ever escaped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be different? Or just another story in the temple's cursed legacy?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851080?t=1760016308","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851080/195b40dc89371c1c228a6e6185e8bd9ebf435407/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760016308","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it